WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.600
I HAVE A FEELING IF DEMOCRATS

00:01.600 --> 00:03.280
DON'T WIN BACK THE HOUSE, THEY

00:03.280 --> 00:04.320
ARE GOING TO TELL THEIR BASE

00:04.320 --> 00:06.400
THAT ICE RIGGED THE VOTE.

00:06.400 --> 00:08.760
TO THEM, NOTHING MATTERS ANYMORE.

00:08.760 --> 00:11.280
SENATORS ARE STILL BACKING A GUY

00:11.280 --> 00:12.520
WHO SAID HE WANTS TO PUT TWO

00:12.520 --> 00:14.040
BULLETS IN REPUBLICANS' HEAD.

